context Project(project) v1
description "Reads a project once, joins the languages through their ports, and checks each file with its language's check (ritsu-project)"

owns
  dir "../crates/ritsu-project"

published language ritsu_project
  crate "../crates/ritsu-project"

upstream Base conformist
  through ritsu_base, ritsu_units, ritsu_proto, ritsu_emit, ritsu_ports

upstream Rules conformist
  through rulec

upstream Workflows conformist
  through dandori

upstream Calendars conformist
  through koyomi

upstream Books conformist
  through chobo

upstream Claims conformist
  through geas

upstream Requirements conformist
  through yuen

upstream ContextMaps conformist
  through sakai
